Package: scRTtools
Title: Single-Cell Replication Timing Analysis Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Hongjie", "Ji", , "hongjieji.pioneer@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Functions for single-cell DNA replication timing analysis
    from 10x multiome data: genome binning, cell QC and G1 identification,
    fragment downsampling, HMM-based replication state inference,
    replication tracks, pseudobulk replication timing, initiation zones,
    replication tempo modelling and replication-expression association
    statistics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
